    "persona_panel": "AI Persona colloquium pannus - engage in authentic conversations cum historical figures, scientists, literary persōna, aut accommodātus personas. Uses prōvectus AI ad simulate period-accurate speech exempla, knowledge, et perspectives. Perfect prō primary fōns analysis, perspective-taking, et empathy-building exercises. subsidium multiple response modus: In-persōna (fully immersive), Educational (cum learning scaffolds), aut mixtus (balanced approach).",
    "persona_card": "AI persona ready prō conversation. quisque schedula mōnstrat persōna's name, time period, et expertise ārea. Pulsā ad incipe interview - AI will respond authentically based in their historical context, beliefs, et knowledge. Ūtere personas prō primary fōns analysis, perspective-taking exercises, aut creative scrīptiō inspiration.",
    "persona_generate_button": "Generā AI personas automaticē ā tuus fōns contentum. systēma analyzes tuus textus ad identificāre key figures, historical periods, aut persōna archetypes et creat authentic conversational partners. Generātus personas inclūde accurate biographical particula, period-aptus vocābulārium, et contextual knowledge limitations (they won't know dē events after their time).",
    "persona_select_button": "Ēlige hoc persona ad begin tuus interview aut conversation. Once ēlectum, tu'll inscrībe immersive colloquium interfaciēs ubi tu potest ask quaestiō, explōrā their perspective, et earn XP prō meaningful exchanges. AI responds based in persōna's historical knowledge, personality, et cultural context.",
    "persona_back_btn": "Return ad persona selection scrīnium ad ēlige different persōna. tuus current conversation prōgressus est automaticē servātum, et tu potest return ad continuā it later. Hoc allows exploring multiple perspectives in idem historical thema.",
    "persona_custom_instructions": "Adde specificus requirements prō quōmodo persona should behave during conversations. exemplum: focus in specificus time period, emphasize certain beliefs aut valor, maintain particular speech exempla, aut limit responses ad historically accurate knowledge. magister potest ūtere hoc ad align personas cum specificus learning objectives.",
    "persona_response_mode": "Ēlige quōmodo persona responds ad creā different learning experiences. IN persōna: Fully immersive historical vōx cum no modern explanations. EDUCATIONAL: persōna speaks sed inclūdit learning scaffolds, vocābulārium subsidium, et context. mixtus: Balanced approach cum authentic vōx plus occasional clarifications. Ēlige based in discipulus readiness et learning fīnis.",
    "persona_free_response": "Type tuus own aperī-ended response instead selecting ā pre-written optiōnēs. Free response modus promotes creative expressiō, critical thinking, et authentic dialogue peritia. Responses sunt analyzed prō historical accūrātiō, empathy, et altitūdō inquiry. Higher-quality quaestiō earn plūs XP.",
    "persona_hints_toggle": "Mōnstrā aut cēlā response suggestions et conversation indicium. cum enabled, systēma provides scaffolded quaestiō starters, historical context monita, et engagement suggestions. Helpful prō discipulus novus ad historical inquiry aut those needing subsidium cum aperī-ended questioning. magister potest prohibe indicium prō plūs prōvectus aestimātiō scenarios.",
    "persona_show_hints": "Ostendere helpful indicium prō engaging cum persona. indicium inclūde historically relevant quaestiō ad ask, topics persōna would find interesting, et monita illud lead ad deeper understanding. Magnus prō discipulus who need scaffolding aut aren't sure quōmodo ad begin historical interview.",
    "persona_submit_btn": "Mitte tuus nūntius ad persona persōna. tuus quaestiō aut response est analyzed prō relevance et altitūdō. AI persona will respond authentically based in their historical context, knowledge, et personality. Well-crafted quaestiō illud mōnstrā historical understanding earn bonus XP.",
    "persona_close": "Claude persona conversation pannus. tuus colloquium history et earned XP sunt automaticē servātum. tu potest resume hoc conversation later ā History tab.",
    "persona_close_title": "Claude Persona colloquium",
    "persona_reflection_input": "Scrībe tuus reflection in conversation prō aestimātiō. Reflect in quid tu learned dē historical figure, quōmodo their perspective differs ā modern viewpoints, et quōmodo hoc conversation changed tuus understanding. Reflections sunt evaluated ūtendō rubric aligned ad historical thinking peritia et potest earn significant XP.",
    "persona_conclude": "End conversation et generā amplissimus summārium tuus discussion. summārium inclūdit: key topics covered, historical insights gained, quality tuus quaestiō, empathy demonstrated, et XP earned. Hoc summārium potest be exported prō aestimātiō, added ad discipulus portfolios, aut ūsus as scrīptiō prompt prō reflection activities.",
    "persona_save_chat": "Servā hoc conversation ad review aut commūnicā later. Saved chats preserve complē dialogue, XP earned, timestamps, et any reflections. Ūtere servātum chats prō discipulus portfolios, aestimātiō testimōnium, classis discussions, aut exemplar models. Saved conversations potest be exported as PDF aut shared cum alius discipulus.",
    "persona_topic_spark": "Get conversation starter aut thema suggestion cum tu're nōn sure quid ad ask. systēma generat historically relevant quaestiō based in persona's background, expertise, et time period. Magnus prō overcoming writer's cubus aut discovering novus angulus ad explōrā in tuus historical inquiry.",
    "persona_auto_send": "automaticē mitte tuus nūntius cum tu dēsiste typing prō few secundae. Creates plūs natural conversational flow, especially cum ūtendō vōx dictation. Prohibe hoc sī tu prefer ad review et recense nūntius before sending, aut sī tu need plūs time ad compose thoughtful responses.",
    "analysis_generate_button": "Resolve tuus fōns textus prō reading gradus, complexitās, et facultātēs.",
    "analysis_check_accuracy": "Fact-check fōns contentum against reliable references.",
    "outline_generate_button": "Generā vīsuālis organizer ā tuus fōns contentum.",
    "timeline_generate_button": "Generā timeline events ā tuus fōns contentum.",
    "timeline_topic": "main thema aut argūmentum timeline being generātum. AI creat historically accurate events based in hoc thema et tuus fōns contentum. exemplum topics: American Revolution, Life Cycle Stars, Shakespeare's Career. Events sunt automaticē ordered chronologically prō sequencing exercē.",
    "timeline_count": "numerus events ad inclūde in timeline. plūs events creā longior, plūs cōpiōsus timelines sed increase difficultās. Recommended: 4-6 events prō beginners, 8-10 prō intermedius, 12+ prō prōvectus discentēs. Events sunt draggable prō sequencing exercē after generātiō.",
    "faq_custom_instructions": "Adde specificus requirements prō FAQ quaestiō (e.g., 'Focus in misconceptions').",
