    "group_modal_container": "classis group manager prō organizing discipulus et subsidia.",
    "group_create_input": "Inscrībe name prō novus discipulus group.",
    "group_create_button": "Creā novus discipulus group cum entered name.",
    "group_roster_list": "Index discipulus in ēlectum group.",
    "roster_panel_header": "classis Roster Key est tuus differentiation command center. Creā discipulus groups cum unique learning profiles (gradus classis, lingua, reading gradus, interests, DOK), then apply those profiles ad any generator. Roster data est stored in tuus browser's local storage et never leaves tuus device unless tu explicitly exportā aut sync ad vīvus sessiō. Ūtere 'Adhibere ad Generator' ad instantly configure cōnstitūtiōnēs prō group, aut 'Differentiate by Group' ad batch-generā subsidia prō omnia groups at once.",
    "roster_import_export": "Importā previously exported roster JSON tabula, aut exportā tuus current roster prō backup aut sharing inter devices. Exported tabula contain group names, color, discipulus assignments, et omnia profile cōnstitūtiōnēs.",
    "roster_sync_session": "Push tuus roster group metadata ad āctīvus Firebase sessiō so discipulus sunt automaticē assigned ad their designated group cum they join. Group-specificus cōnstitūtiōnēs (TTS celeritās, karaoke modus) take effect in discipulus devices.",
    "roster_batch_generate": "Generā differentiated subsidia prō every group simultaneously. Ēlige which subsidia types ad creā (adapted textus, glōssārium, quaestiōnārium, etc.) et systēma will iterate per quisque group, applying their profile cōnstitūtiōnēs before generandō. subsidia sunt tagged cum group identifiers prō facilis filtering.",
    "bridge_send_button": "Aperī Bridge modus ad mitte bilinguis nūntius ad discipulus during vīvus īnstrūctiō. Type conceptus, sententia, aut īnstrūctiō, ēlige modus (Explain, Translate, aut vīsuālis+Explain), et ēlige scopus group. nūntius est generātum ūtendō AI cum group's lingua et reading gradus cōnstitūtiōnēs, then displayed as large, readable bilinguis pannus in discipulus devices cum TTS et karaoke highlighting.",
