      "protein_structure": "Structura proteini",
      "primary_sequence_secondary_helix_sheet": "Primaria (sequentia) → secundaria (α-helix, β-lamina) → tertiaria (plicatio 3D) → quaternaria (multisubunitas). Una permutatio aminoacidi plicationem rumpere potest.",
      "dna_forensics": "Genetica forensis",
