      "reliability_0_70_0_85_fine_for_routine": "Reliability 0.70-0.85 — fine for routine screening, NOT for placement or eligibility decisions.",
      "reliability_0_70_error_variance_30_of_": "Reliability < 0.70 — error variance ≥ 30% of total variance. Acceptable for some group-level research questions, but the confidence interval around any individual score is too wide for high-stakes individual decisions (placement, eligibility, diagnosis).",
