      "500_million_similar_to_a_dog": "500 million (similar to a dog)",
      "500_million_year_old_lineage_lives_ins": "500-million-year-old lineage. Lives inside a spiral chambered shell — natural permanent shelter. ~90 arms, no suckers. Buoyancy controlled by gas in shell chambers. No camo (shell prevents it), but predators bounce off the shell — 70% damage reduction. Slowest species.",
