      "pick_the_showiest_for_3_rounds_then_sw": "Pick the showiest for 3 rounds, then switch to picking modestly showy birds. The trait briefly drops, but the genetic momentum from earlier rounds means it doesn't crash all the way down. Selection has memory.",
      "plants": "🌳 Plants",
      "plants_evolved_chemical_defenses_caffe": "Plants evolved chemical defenses (caffeine, capsaicin, alkaloids). Some insects evolved enzymes to detoxify those defenses. Plants evolved BETTER toxins. Caterpillars evolved BETTER detox. This is happening right now in milkweed-monarch interactions.",
