      "depth_adult_child_infant": "Depth: at least 2 in (5 cm) and no more than about 2.4 in (6 cm) for an adult; about 2 in (5 cm) for a child; about 1.5 in (4 cm) for an infant — in each case roughly one third of the depth of the chest. Source: AHA 2020 Guidelines for CPR & ECC.",
