      "creates_permanent_film_digital_record_": "Creates permanent film/digital record (legal documentation). Detects volumetric defects (porosity, slag inclusions, lack of fusion, cracks transverse to bead). Standard for code-required pipe work.",
      "cross_country_pipeline_welding": "🛢 Cross-country pipeline welding",
